menu "Passport Pager"
    config PAGER_SIM_NO_BLE
        bool "Skip Bluetooth (simulator UI build only)"
        default n
        help
            PassportSim binds BLE only for ESP-IDF 5.5.3 images. This builds a variant that
            never starts the Bluetooth controller, so the screen and buttons can be tested there.
            Never enable it for firmware that goes on the device.
endmenu
